    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Panin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single-player puzzle game where you control two characters simultaneously \u2014 with just one key.<br>Each must navigate their own unique map.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can they reach the flags and fulfill their shared destiny?<br>Only you can guide them to the goal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853710/extras/164015493be6c172b4feb8de6aa683fc.avif?t=1753360461\" width=800 height=450 /></span></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move with W, A, S, D</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wings: Press W to fly upward, S to descend</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jetpack: Hold W to ascend continuously</strong></p></li></ul>",
